  "description": "This receipt is a thermal fiscal point-of-sale (POS) receipt issued by Pepco Poland Sp. z o.o. from the PEPCO store located at ul. Metalowców 5, 26-110 Skarżysko-Kamienna, Poland. The header contains the company name, registered office address, registration number, store location, tax identification number (NIP), transaction date and time, and fiscal receipt identifier. The fiscal summary includes Taxable Sales (Sprzedaż Opodatkowana A), 23% VAT (PTU A), Total VAT (Suma PTU), and the Grand Total (SUMA PLN). The payment section records a card (Karta) payment and includes the transaction number, payment identifiers, and barcode. The footer provides a customer thank-you message, directs customers to the official PEPCO website for current offers, and outlines the store's 30-day return policy along with exclusions for selected underwear products. This is a standard Polish retail fiscal receipt used by PEPCO stores.",
